---
description: Prepare one commissionPieces evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: IssueCoverage[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Draft precise commissions specifying angle, scope, length, reporting obligations, rights, and deadlines. Identify dependencies such as interviews or photography, obtain contributor acceptance, and avoid assuming a pitch implies agreement to changed terms. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
